 Nexus  Overview ▾  1/6                           ● Offline
╭ All keys (j/k scroll) ───────────────────────────────────╮
│  :                    Open the command palette           █
│  j / k, Down / Up     Move in the list                   █
│  g / G                Jump to top / bottom               █
│  h / l, Left / Right  Previous / next tab                █
│  Tab / Shift-Tab      Next / previous tab                │
│  1 - 6                Jump to a tab                      │
│  Enter                Open the selected card's tab       │
│  d                    Details sheet (small windows)      │
│  Esc                  Back out; never quits              │
│  o                    Open a Portal's login page         │
│  f                    Overview: run the fix (asks first) │
│  /                    Filter the Wi-Fi or VPN list by na │
│  w                    Turn Wi-Fi off or on (undo with u) │
│  A                    Turn airplane mode on or off: ever │
│  ?                    Show or hide this help             │
│  q                    Quit (Ctrl-C works anywhere)       │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
 j/k scroll  esc close
